WEBVTT

00:07.430 --> 00:10.770
The Santa I work for is tiny and cute.

00:11.470 --> 00:14.240
I'm delivering a bunch 
of presents again this year!

00:14.240 --> 00:16.590
Let's work hard, reindeer!

00:17.030 --> 00:17.740
Right!

00:17.870 --> 00:22.000
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho...

00:20.210 --> 00:22.000
<i>Looks heavy.</i>

00:23.650 --> 00:24.650
Santa!

00:25.320 --> 00:26.850
If you don't mind...

00:32.020 --> 00:33.540
Uh, Santa?

00:34.970 --> 00:37.260
I know we're going to be really busy today,

00:37.260 --> 00:39.920
but let's try not to overdo it.

00:39.920 --> 00:42.350
We'll be efficient and avoid overtime.

00:44.450 --> 00:45.300
Well...

00:45.300 --> 00:46.140
Yes?

00:46.550 --> 00:49.770
I wasn't reaching out... for a hug...

00:50.100 --> 00:52.770
but rather offering to carry your packages...

00:56.780 --> 00:58.900
I am so sorry!

00:59.290 --> 01:02.290
Don't worry! Let's do a good job today!

01:02.790 --> 01:06.040
<i>Mistake or not, she gave me a hug.</i>

01:06.810 --> 01:08.410
<i>Well, it's Christmas...</i>

01:08.820 --> 01:11.450
<i>so it's probably fine, right?</i>

01:12.420 --> 01:13.440
Santa?

01:13.440 --> 01:15.420
R-Right! On my way!

01:17.290 --> 01:20.300
Happy, merry Christmas!

01:23.180 --> 01:25.140
A... A dream?

01:27.230 --> 01:33.980
Manager

01:27.230 --> 01:33.980
Don't worry about the dream

01:28.260 --> 01:30.330
<i>Don't worry about the dream.</i>

01:30.970 --> 01:32.700
How did he know?!

01:34.420 --> 01:41.100
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

01:45.960 --> 01:50.720
My Tiny Senpai

01:51.460 --> 01:53.800
<i>We've got an emergency here</i>

01:54.210 --> 01:56.580
<i>Are you paying attention, me?</i>

01:56.970 --> 02:02.810
<i>There's someone other than me 
dancing around inside of my heart</i>

02:02.810 --> 02:05.060
<i>I want to talk to her</i>

02:05.560 --> 02:08.100
<i>I want to touch her</i>

02:08.100 --> 02:13.600
<i>Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down</i>

02:14.110 --> 02:16.820
<i>What in the world am I doing?</i>

02:16.820 --> 02:19.570
<i>You're right next to me</i>

02:19.570 --> 02:25.830
<i>And this is the perfect chance...</i>

02:26.580 --> 02:27.410
<i>HONEY</i>

02:27.410 --> 02:32.120
<i>I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste</i>

02:32.120 --> 02:35.330
<i>And I don't think I can ever escape</i>

02:35.330 --> 02:37.830
<i>I may as well just sink into it</i>

02:37.830 --> 02:38.640
<i>HONEY</i>

02:38.640 --> 02:43.430
<i>It's another day in your dazzling presence</i>

02:43.650 --> 02:46.430
<i>We may never be 
on the same page with this love but</i>

02:46.430 --> 02:52.870
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

03:05.550 --> 03:08.700
Wow, look at all those people!

03:08.750 --> 03:13.750
#06 I Can't Resist My Instincts!

03:09.510 --> 03:13.450
Sorry to ask you to help me sell...

03:13.450 --> 03:16.210
Not a problem! It's not like I was busy.

03:16.210 --> 03:20.970
Besides, I helped you draw it, 
so of course I'd help you sell it!

03:20.970 --> 03:22.750
Helping me draw it...

03:24.190 --> 03:25.470
That was...

03:27.470 --> 03:32.980
<b>m0 0 l 100 0 l 100 25 l 0 25</b>

03:27.470 --> 03:32.980
<b>Days Earlier</b>

03:27.850 --> 03:31.140
You look exhausted. Working on your manuscript?

03:31.140 --> 03:32.980
Deadline's the day after tomorrow.

03:33.320 --> 03:37.160
And all my friends who usually 
help out are super busy, so...

03:37.160 --> 03:39.060
That sounds rough.

03:39.540 --> 03:40.510
What's all this?

03:41.110 --> 03:42.780
You need some help?

03:43.270 --> 03:44.370
M-Manager!

03:49.140 --> 03:50.700
It's not work-related, so...

03:51.030 --> 03:53.120
I'll do anything I can!

03:54.510 --> 03:57.980
Still... there are certain technical 
qualifications involved.

03:57.980 --> 03:59.230
Hayakawa-san.

04:00.540 --> 04:04.210
This is a template for in-store installations 
that the manager drew before!

04:04.210 --> 04:05.090
Wow!

04:05.490 --> 04:07.270
What is this, a new game plus for you?

04:07.660 --> 04:09.100
I haven't reincarnated, no.

04:11.490 --> 04:13.820
Manager, can you hear me?

04:13.820 --> 04:15.530
Loud and clear!

04:15.530 --> 04:18.190
I'm gonna upload something to the cloud. 
Let me know when you see it.

04:18.710 --> 04:19.610
Got it!

04:19.900 --> 04:23.740
In that case, could you start
with pages 16 to 22?

04:23.740 --> 04:25.040
Roger!

04:25.040 --> 04:27.990
Could you take a look 
when I finish the first page?

04:27.990 --> 04:29.140
Understood.

04:29.940 --> 04:33.970
<i>It might be an 18 plus BL book, 
but that scene isn't too sexy...</i>

04:33.970 --> 04:35.870
<i>I'm glad I was able to get help.</i>

04:36.980 --> 04:39.770
<i>I'm really impressed, Hayakawa-san.</i>

04:40.880 --> 04:44.880
It's amazing that you can create something 
so incredible from scratch.

04:45.770 --> 04:47.890
Thank you...

04:49.160 --> 04:51.540
<i>I appreciate it, but considering it's 18 plus BL...</i>

04:51.540 --> 04:54.970
<i>And with it being a derivative work, 
it's not exactly from scratch!</i>

04:55.500 --> 04:57.150
I finished my first page!

04:57.860 --> 04:59.060
Check it out!

04:59.470 --> 05:00.670
O-Okay.

05:01.860 --> 05:03.350
Wow!

05:03.900 --> 05:04.780
But...

05:05.140 --> 05:08.750
I accidentally asked him 
to handle a sexy scene!

05:12.060 --> 05:16.040
Gotta say, that was a lot of fun! 
Our first project together.

05:16.340 --> 05:19.290
Now that this 18 plus BL book is finished,

05:19.290 --> 05:21.420
it's the product of our love!

05:21.420 --> 05:24.550
That's not exactly wrong, 
but could be interpreted in a weird way!

05:24.970 --> 05:28.310
Here's hoping the product 
of our love sells a lot!

05:28.310 --> 05:31.490
Maybe that's what I should have 
titled the book...

05:32.910 --> 05:34.940
Chika-chan! It's been ages!

05:35.850 --> 05:39.130
How've you been? It's been a while 
since I've seen you IRL.

05:39.130 --> 05:40.540
I'm pretty good!

05:40.540 --> 05:42.190
It was last summer, 
right, Haruna-chan?

05:42.940 --> 05:44.190
And this is...?

05:44.530 --> 05:46.030
Nice to meet you!

05:46.850 --> 05:47.520
Your boyfriend!

05:47.520 --> 05:48.450
No!

05:48.450 --> 05:49.730
I told you!

05:49.730 --> 05:52.830
I needed some help, and someone 
from work was nice enough to offer!

05:53.390 --> 05:55.540
So you work with him...

05:56.150 --> 05:57.120
and he's your boyfriend!

05:57.120 --> 05:58.580
Why would you assume that?!

05:59.000 --> 06:02.010
Oh! On your bag there...

06:02.010 --> 06:04.090
Isn't that Hime-chan from <i>Kimihime-chan</i>?

06:04.420 --> 06:07.040
You know it?! That's impressive!

06:07.040 --> 06:10.220
I just started watching it 
after it was recommended to me!

06:11.220 --> 06:12.430
By my girl here.

06:12.970 --> 06:14.970
<b>My girl
= Girlfriend</b>

06:14.970 --> 06:16.980
<b>My girl
= Chummy</b>

06:17.460 --> 06:18.580
So he really is your boyfriend!

06:18.580 --> 06:21.230
I keep telling you, no!

06:22.790 --> 06:25.980
<i>Well, everyone, have a good year!</i>

06:28.140 --> 06:29.990
<i>The year's almost over...</i>

06:32.240 --> 06:33.870
Shinozaki Takuma

06:38.670 --> 06:41.620
<i>Well, we did exchange contact information...</i>

06:43.670 --> 06:46.670
<i>The annual event is being held again this year,</i>

06:47.010 --> 06:49.450
<i>and as you can see, there are 
a ton of guests yet again.</i>

06:48.650 --> 06:51.410
I wonder who's calling so late?

06:51.010 --> 06:52.810
<i>How did you enjoy the event?</i>

06:53.330 --> 06:54.560
<i>Uh, is this for TV?</i>

06:54.560 --> 06:56.720
Katase Shiori (Senpai)

06:54.560 --> 06:58.050
<i>Honestly, great! Her BL book 
has been a huge success!</i>

06:55.100 --> 06:56.720
S-Senpai?!

06:57.040 --> 06:58.730
Senpai's calling?!

06:58.050 --> 06:59.600
<i>Manager, come on!</i>

06:59.600 --> 07:02.500
<i>Right... that's right!</i>

07:02.500 --> 07:05.110
<i>We did trade contact info!</i>

07:05.550 --> 07:08.320
<i>I'm such a lucky guy!</i>

07:08.320 --> 07:09.190
I mean...

07:09.700 --> 07:11.140
Better answer.

07:11.140 --> 07:13.200
Uh, hello, this is Shinozaki.

07:13.650 --> 07:17.800
<i>Sorry, I'm at my parents' house right now... 
It's been kind of busy.</i>

07:17.800 --> 07:21.490
Is everything okay? 
I'm sorry for calling so late.

07:21.490 --> 07:23.080
<i>No, it's totally fine!</i>

07:23.950 --> 07:25.090
What's up?

07:25.770 --> 07:29.610
I just wanted to thank you
for everything this year.

07:30.400 --> 07:32.090
Thank me?

07:33.050 --> 07:34.090
Yeah.

07:34.470 --> 07:37.420
You did a really great job over the last year.

07:37.820 --> 07:42.150
Working with you helped me do better, too.

07:45.020 --> 07:48.340
No! I feel like I was more 
a nuisance than anything...

07:49.940 --> 07:55.620
Y'know, when your senpai thanks you, 
it's okay to think "Wow, I did a great job!"

07:55.620 --> 07:59.040
Wow, I did a great job... then.

07:59.040 --> 08:01.500
There you go! Well done.

08:01.500 --> 08:06.380
Oh, wait, was that one last abuse 
of authority before the year was over?

08:06.690 --> 08:11.260
<i>I'm hoping she'll continue to abuse 
her authority in this way next year, too!</i>

08:11.690 --> 08:12.550
But...

08:13.010 --> 08:17.780
I'm really glad you're my kohai, Shinozaki-san.

08:19.410 --> 08:21.270
Me, too. I'm glad you're my senpai, Senpai...

08:23.860 --> 08:24.820
I'm...

08:26.100 --> 08:29.280
I wouldn't want anyone else...

08:29.680 --> 08:32.150
<i>for my senpai, Shiori-san.</i>

08:36.980 --> 08:40.180
Well, uh, here's to another year 
working together!

08:40.180 --> 08:42.740
R-Right, let's keep up the good work...

08:46.750 --> 08:51.000
Manager

08:46.750 --> 08:51.000
I sensed something

08:46.750 --> 08:51.000
You should go to the Hatsumode

08:47.130 --> 08:48.760
<i>I sensed something.</i>

08:48.760 --> 08:50.050
<i>You should go to the Hatsumode.</i>

08:50.050 --> 08:51.000
<i>Manager?!</i>

08:51.890 --> 08:56.470
<i>Hatsumode... 
Visiting a shrine with Senpai...</i>

08:57.270 --> 08:58.940
<i>Maybe I should invite her.</i>

09:00.750 --> 09:03.700
Li'l bro. You've got a girlfriend, don't you?

09:03.390 --> 09:04.480
m 0 0 l 140 0 l 140 75 l 0 75

09:03.390 --> 09:04.480
<b>Shinozaki Yutaka
(Takuma's older sister)</b>

09:05.080 --> 09:05.800
Huh?

09:06.480 --> 09:08.860
No, no, and where did that even come from?!

09:08.860 --> 09:09.980
I don't!

09:10.460 --> 09:13.530
There's no way you'd buy 
that cute little getup on your own.

09:13.530 --> 09:15.990
A-A senpai from work gave it to me.

09:16.370 --> 09:18.490
A senpai from work...

09:18.940 --> 09:20.990
Wh-What now?

09:21.950 --> 09:23.250
She's a woman, isn't she?

09:23.810 --> 09:25.910
W-Well, yeah...

09:26.830 --> 09:30.210
Now, hold on! It's not like that!

09:30.570 --> 09:34.320
I see... so at long last, 
my little brother has found a woman.

09:34.320 --> 09:35.970
Listen to me!

09:37.060 --> 09:40.900
<i>My Tiny Senpai</i>. Meow!

09:42.670 --> 09:45.740
Shinozaki-san invited me to Hatsumode.

09:45.740 --> 09:47.980
I wonder what I should wear?

09:49.270 --> 09:52.150
<i>There's a senpai where I work...</i>

09:54.650 --> 09:57.150
Please adopt me

09:55.150 --> 09:57.150
<i>who is a tiny cat!</i>

09:57.490 --> 10:00.870
What happened, Senpai?!
What's going on here?!

10:00.870 --> 10:02.870
<b>Please adopt me</b>

10:01.260 --> 10:02.870
And it looks like you've been abandoned?

10:04.310 --> 10:06.920
Meeeow! Mew mew!

10:07.370 --> 10:11.070
<i>Wh-Wh-What is happening?!</i>

10:11.070 --> 10:13.660
<i>She's cute... too damn cute!</i>

10:15.630 --> 10:18.510
W-Will she get mad if I touch her...?

10:28.130 --> 10:32.020
<i>What is this?! Am I going to die?! 
Killed by cuteness?!</i>

10:37.640 --> 10:40.640
M-Meow...

10:42.570 --> 10:45.790
<b>Cause
of death:
cuteness</b>

10:42.990 --> 10:44.970
<i>Cause of death: cuteness.</i>

10:45.790 --> 10:48.740
<i>"Please adopt me." I can't...</i>

10:48.740 --> 10:51.540
<i>If I take Senpai home when she's this cute...</i>

10:51.980 --> 10:55.050
<i>my heart won't be able to take it.</i>

11:01.470 --> 11:03.470
S-S-Senpai?!

11:05.970 --> 11:09.350
I-I know you're cat, but you can't!

11:09.350 --> 11:11.980
Some things are just 
not appropriate, even for animals...

11:12.400 --> 11:13.680
Meow...

11:16.140 --> 11:17.730
Meow...

11:23.130 --> 11:26.220
<i>I can't believe my first dream of 
the new year was like something like that...</i>

11:28.750 --> 11:33.080
Manager

11:28.750 --> 11:33.080
Don't worry about the dream

11:29.980 --> 11:31.860
<i>Don't worry about the dream.</i>

11:31.860 --> 11:32.620
<i>Again?!</i>

11:37.460 --> 11:42.070
<i>I woke up... and meow I'm a cat!</i>

11:42.590 --> 11:45.810
<i>Wh-Wh-What's happened to meow?!</i>

11:45.810 --> 11:49.720
<i>And this sign... did someone throw meow out?!</i>

11:49.720 --> 11:50.340
Huh?

11:51.670 --> 11:52.860
An abandoned cat?

11:53.730 --> 11:55.480
<i>Sh-Shinozaki-san?!</i>

11:55.860 --> 11:59.360
<i>I actually look like a cat to him, don't I?!</i>

12:00.860 --> 12:03.240
Will she get mad if I touch her?

12:05.930 --> 12:07.740
<i>My kohai from work...</i>

12:08.100 --> 12:12.540
<i>I should be embarrassed... 
to have him see meow like this...</i>

12:13.250 --> 12:15.750
<i>M-My body...</i>

12:16.100 --> 12:18.750
<i>It's... got this urge...</i>

12:19.490 --> 12:24.260
<i>I-I don't think I can...</i>

12:26.370 --> 12:28.810
<i>resist meow instincts!</i>

12:29.670 --> 12:32.530
<i>Pet me! Pay attention to me!</i>

12:33.780 --> 12:36.340
<i>For meow to be doing this...</i>

12:38.230 --> 12:40.390
<i>I'm embarrassed,</i>

12:42.300 --> 12:44.210
<i>but can't resist!</i>

12:45.280 --> 12:48.280
What is it? You want me to pet you?

12:51.210 --> 12:52.370
There you go.

12:56.410 --> 13:00.910
<i>Shinozaki-san's big hands feel so nice...</i>

13:06.690 --> 13:09.810
Does it feel good when I touch you there?

13:11.380 --> 13:16.060
<i>Sh-Shinozaki-san! When you say it like that, 
it sounds naughty to meow!</i>

13:17.230 --> 13:18.060
<i>But...</i>

13:19.700 --> 13:21.380
<i>it does feel good.</i>

13:22.980 --> 13:24.230
<i>Which is why...</i>

13:25.940 --> 13:27.900
<i>I'd want you to pet me...</i>

13:28.490 --> 13:30.580
<i>when I'm not a cat.</i>

13:31.300 --> 13:33.180
<i>Shinozaki-san...</i>

13:36.500 --> 13:40.190
That's one crazy dream 
to start the new year with...

13:42.250 --> 13:46.580
Manager

13:42.250 --> 13:46.580
Don't mind the dream

13:43.780 --> 13:45.670
<i>Don't worry about the dream.</i>

13:46.350 --> 13:48.590
<i>How did he know?!</i>

13:51.770 --> 13:54.540
<i>I'm Shinozaki Yutaka, an office worker.</i>

13:56.250 --> 13:59.380
<i>And my brother has been 
acting weird since he got home.</i>

14:03.110 --> 14:04.840
I'm going out tomorrow.

14:04.840 --> 14:07.000
Oh, really? With who?

14:07.000 --> 14:07.860
Someone from work.

14:07.860 --> 14:12.330
My bangs are getting long... 
Maybe I should've gotten a haircut.

14:13.620 --> 14:15.120
I'm positive.

14:15.730 --> 14:17.700
He's absolutely got a woman!

14:19.060 --> 14:23.130
Li'l bro. Time for a psychology test.

14:23.620 --> 14:25.380
Where is this even coming from...?

14:25.740 --> 14:30.430
You're walking down a road, 
and you see three animals in front of you.

14:30.910 --> 14:33.720
If you could give rubbies 
to one of them, which one?

14:34.380 --> 14:35.720
"Rubbies"?

14:35.720 --> 14:37.780
A: A clever doggy.

14:39.790 --> 14:42.310
B: A sexy female cougar.

14:42.310 --> 14:44.300
These options are getting weird...

14:45.010 --> 14:46.740
C: A cute little kitten.

14:48.980 --> 14:51.030
The kitten... I guess.

14:54.430 --> 14:58.790
<i>I see. Then his woman must be the kitty type.</i>

14:59.390 --> 15:02.030
Now, how is this kitten behaving?

15:02.030 --> 15:03.290
There's more?!

15:03.290 --> 15:06.500
<b>Fluffy</b>

15:03.660 --> 15:05.230
A: Fluffy.

15:06.420 --> 15:11.010
<b>Meow-meow-ey</b>

15:06.930 --> 15:08.700
B: Meow-meow-ey

15:08.700 --> 15:11.250
Aren't these all typical for cats...?

15:10.930 --> 15:14.800
<b>Smiley</b>

15:11.250 --> 15:13.090
C: Smiley.

15:13.090 --> 15:14.800
Can animal's smile?!

15:15.220 --> 15:20.310
I guess... fluffy, meow-meow-ey, and smiley?

15:23.350 --> 15:29.890
<i>I see. Then my brother's girl is 
like a fluffy, meow-meow-ey, smiley kitty...</i>

15:30.730 --> 15:32.750
<i>In that case, I should check her out.</i>

15:33.190 --> 15:38.070
<i>This fluffy, meow-meow-ey, 
smiley kitty woman of his!</i>

15:41.540 --> 15:42.250
Senpai!

15:42.250 --> 15:43.690
Shinozaki-san!

15:54.310 --> 15:56.480
Happy New Year.

15:56.480 --> 15:59.130
I'm looking forward to 
working together this year.

15:59.980 --> 16:02.180
<i>S-So cute...</i>

16:02.980 --> 16:04.730
Happy New Year.

16:05.420 --> 16:07.480
The feeling is mutual.

16:08.630 --> 16:09.990
<i>Shinozaki-san...</i>

16:14.580 --> 16:15.740
<i>Senpai...</i>

16:19.980 --> 16:23.750
<i>This is awkward, after that dream...</i>

16:23.750 --> 16:27.290
Looks like we're in for another sweet year!

16:27.290 --> 16:29.250
What are you talking about, Manager?

16:29.250 --> 16:31.030
I mean, come on!

16:31.700 --> 16:34.050
Wh-What's that supposed to mean, Manager?

16:34.480 --> 16:38.630
<i>That's it... It must be. 
My brother's woman.</i>

16:39.260 --> 16:41.210
<i>Wh-Wh-What in the world?!</i>

16:41.210 --> 16:43.770
<i>What even is that adorable, little thing?!</i>

16:44.270 --> 16:46.810
<i>Her hair is so fluffy!</i>

16:46.810 --> 16:49.770
<i>And she's meow-meow-ey and smiley...</i>

16:56.690 --> 16:58.970
Yes, quite fluffy indeed.

17:00.330 --> 17:02.540
What are you even doing, Sis?!

17:03.050 --> 17:05.980
I'm performing a background check, clearly.

17:06.990 --> 17:10.130
Are you Shinozaki-san's big sister?

17:10.130 --> 17:12.840
Indeed. Forgive me for startling you.

17:12.840 --> 17:14.860
My name is Katase. 
We work in the same department.

17:14.860 --> 17:17.840
Your brother is always a ton of help.

17:21.920 --> 17:23.350
Enough, already!

17:23.750 --> 17:26.400
His sister never changes...

17:26.400 --> 17:28.370
What do you mean?

17:28.370 --> 17:31.610
She's always gone crazy 
over small, cute things.

17:34.330 --> 17:36.100
May I take her home with me?

17:36.100 --> 17:37.990
Obviously not!

17:38.490 --> 17:40.150
Shinozaki-kun's sister.

17:41.180 --> 17:41.870
Who's this?

17:42.170 --> 17:44.200
This is our department's manager.

17:44.200 --> 17:45.680
Oh, Chika-chan's here, too.

17:45.680 --> 17:46.870
It's a pleasure to meat you.

17:46.870 --> 17:48.660
My brother's boss...

17:49.010 --> 17:53.410
Katase-san and Shinozaki-kun 
are such a great pair,

17:53.410 --> 17:57.530
which is evident by how 
excellently they work together.

17:58.320 --> 18:01.540
Shinozaki-kun's thorough 
but over-cautious approach

18:01.540 --> 18:05.200
is an excellent match for Katase-san's 
dynamic and supportive style.

18:05.200 --> 18:07.200
On top of their contributions to the team,

18:07.200 --> 18:10.470
they also help set 
a positive tone in the office.

18:13.310 --> 18:14.650
I'm curious, miss...

18:14.650 --> 18:15.650
The name's Yutaka.

18:16.090 --> 18:17.120
Yutaka-san.

18:17.120 --> 18:19.740
Do you have any siblings 
other than Shinozaki-kun?

18:20.220 --> 18:23.320
It's just the two of us.

18:23.320 --> 18:27.130
How do you feel about... 
having a tiny, cute little sister?

18:27.130 --> 18:29.170
Well, let's see...

18:29.570 --> 18:33.420
Ideally, she'd be fluffy, 
and meow-meow-ey, like this.

18:33.980 --> 18:37.340
You realize... you'd get one 
if your brother marries her.

18:40.420 --> 18:44.450
Big sister!

18:44.450 --> 18:46.180
Big... sister...

18:47.530 --> 18:49.110
Big sister!

18:51.170 --> 18:51.940
Yes!

18:52.700 --> 18:53.830
Li'l bro!

18:58.530 --> 19:00.320
So, when's the wedding?

19:00.320 --> 19:01.570
Wha...

19:02.820 --> 19:04.340
Go home!

19:04.340 --> 19:07.800
You're both adults, so there shouldn't be 
any problems in terms of age.

19:07.800 --> 19:10.580
Did it not occur to you 
there are other considerations?!

19:11.000 --> 19:12.530
Get Married Beam!

19:12.530 --> 19:14.090
There's no such beam!

19:14.740 --> 19:17.100
You seriously haven't changed.

19:18.550 --> 19:20.280
And you should 
stop toying with them, Manager!

19:20.280 --> 19:22.090
But come on!

19:22.500 --> 19:24.330
I'm so sorry, Senpai...

19:24.330 --> 19:26.850
My sister can be really rude.

19:26.850 --> 19:28.100
It's okay...

19:28.780 --> 19:31.100
It's good to see you two get along.

19:32.090 --> 19:33.880
Is that what it looks like?

19:33.880 --> 19:36.020
I'm not so sure.

19:37.130 --> 19:41.610
We always tended to like the same things, 
so we'd end up fighting over stuff.

19:42.180 --> 19:44.620
<i>You like the same things...</i>

19:48.070 --> 19:50.550
I... I see.

19:51.730 --> 19:54.590
Does that mean, Shinozaki-san...

19:55.050 --> 19:56.630
When it comes to me...

19:58.550 --> 20:00.420
Er, well...

20:02.350 --> 20:03.490
You two!

20:04.660 --> 20:07.360
I get to give a speech at the wedding, right?

20:07.360 --> 20:08.140
No, it's me, right?!

20:08.460 --> 20:10.390
As the groom's sister, it's me!

20:10.390 --> 20:12.890
I'm both the groom and 
the bride's boss. It should be me!

20:12.890 --> 20:14.020
Me!

20:14.490 --> 20:15.150
Me!

20:15.150 --> 20:16.740
It has to be me!

20:16.740 --> 20:18.170
No, no, me!

20:18.170 --> 20:19.970
Me! Me!

20:19.610 --> 20:20.900
Me! Me!

20:20.250 --> 20:22.900
<i>Hard to say whether they get along or not...</i>

20:20.420 --> 20:22.210
Me! Me!

20:21.620 --> 20:22.900
Me! Me!

20:23.260 --> 20:24.660
So, which one?!

20:26.930 --> 20:28.910
Which one what?!

20:30.930 --> 20:34.660
Come to think of it, does Yutaka-san 
ever mess with you, Hayakawa-san?

20:35.830 --> 20:41.170
Well, I'm not small or cute, after all.

20:46.550 --> 20:49.830
You seem small and cute to me.

20:56.610 --> 20:59.400
Manager... listen...

20:59.400 --> 21:00.920
For favors at the ceremony,

21:00.920 --> 21:03.580
we can give away these cute plates 
with a print of Shiorin on them.

21:03.580 --> 21:05.250
I'm "Shiorin" now...?

21:05.250 --> 21:06.730
Wait, what about me?

21:06.730 --> 21:07.660
No one cares.

21:07.660 --> 21:08.660
Why not?!

21:08.660 --> 21:11.530
The trend these days is to have people 
pick from a catalog, anyway.

21:11.530 --> 21:13.830
Don't encourage her, Manager!

21:15.570 --> 21:17.580
Enough already!

21:17.580 --> 21:18.330
Okay.

21:20.390 --> 21:23.840
Come on, let's all head to the shrine together!

21:23.840 --> 21:27.100
Sounds good. I wonder 
if there'll be food stalls.

21:25.350 --> 21:26.680
You want one of these?

21:26.680 --> 21:27.620
No, I don't.

21:27.100 --> 21:29.010
I sure hope so!

21:27.620 --> 21:28.620
Wanna put the cat ears on?

21:28.620 --> 21:29.300
No, I don't!

21:29.300 --> 21:30.420
They're so cute, though...

21:30.420 --> 21:31.970
Never!

21:31.620 --> 21:32.930
Oh, cotton candy!

21:46.260 --> 21:50.140
<i>Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream</i>

21:50.140 --> 21:55.040
<i>I still can't bring myself 
to drink that bitter coffee</i>

21:55.600 --> 21:59.520
<i>So I sneakily toss in 
two pinches of a sweet secret</i>

21:59.520 --> 22:03.740
<i>And let it slowly spread throughout</i>

22:04.960 --> 22:08.700
<i>There's a local bakery 
that's only open sometimes</i>

22:08.700 --> 22:13.590
<i>Where I once had some toast that glittered</i>

22:14.250 --> 22:18.090
<i>What is it that makes it so satisfying?</i>

22:18.090 --> 22:22.260
<i>Almost like magic</i>

22:22.680 --> 22:27.340
<i>I find myself thinking about that kind of thing</i>

22:27.340 --> 22:32.950
<i>How the small things can be the most precious</i>

22:33.700 --> 22:37.740
<i>Deep inside my heart</i>

22:37.740 --> 22:42.140
<i>It's ever so bittersweet</i>

22:43.010 --> 22:47.060
<i>"Just being around you is enough"</i>

22:47.060 --> 22:51.080
<i>Becomes my mantra</i>

22:51.080 --> 22:53.370
<i>Baby like sugar</i>

23:00.480 --> 23:02.700
<i>Baby you're the sugar</i>
